 r←multipartmixedRqb requests;NL;boundary;request;payload
 ⍝ Combines multiple requests into a new request body according to Odata multipart/mixed batch request format.
 ⍝ requests: an array of requests from HttpCommand.Show
 ⍝ r: 2 elements, boundary and request body.

 NL←⎕UCS 13 10
 boundary←50{⍵[?⍺⍴≢⍵]}⎕D,⎕A,⎕C ⎕A
 payload←''
 :For request :In requests
     payload,←'--',boundary,NL
     payload,←'Content-Type: application/http',NL
     payload,←request
 :EndFor
 payload,←'--',boundary,'--'

 r←boundary payload
